      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is true for any of the new selectables as well: stickers, portals, and items. \n\nThe text states that it should be disabled if it interferes with world interactions but I don't think the new laser user selection should be defaulted on. A better alternative is to make it press to hold or put it on another key.",
